From d87edba389fc84712193a790c2c947376b83cb48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:21:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] panfrost: kbase/G615 investigation scaffold + opt-in
 unknown-model fallback

---
 src/panfrost/base/include/PORT_NOTES.h    |  27 +++
 src/panfrost/lib/kmod/kbase_kmod.c        | 278 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/panfrost/lib/kmod/kbase_kmod.h        |  45 ++++
 src/panfrost/lib/kmod/meson.build         |   5 +
 src/panfrost/model/pan_model.c            |  80 +++++++
 src/panfrost/tools/meson.build            |  16 ++
 src/panfrost/tools/panfrost_gpuid_probe.c | 135 +++++++++++
 7 files changed, 586 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/panfrost/base/include/PORT_NOTES.h
